.git
.gitignore
**/*.zip
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/node_modules/
# Verifier and reference material must never reach the agent image. Both sit
# beside this directory rather than inside it, and the build context is this
# directory, so these two lines match nothing today: the real scoping is the
# Dockerfile's COPY app/ /app/, which takes the data tree and nothing else.
# They stay as belt and braces against a future Dockerfile built from the task
# root, where they would matter.
tests/
solution/
# Local secrets and environment overrides.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
